  "explanation": {
    "body": "Its forecast takes this form: timing and distribution, over 5, 10, 21 and 60 sessions (cap 60). It is graded on whether its timing calls resolve by each stated horizon, with unresolved cases still counted. It would be ended if after 30 matured cohorts, its timing Brier is no better than the unconditional hazard. It counts as proven at 30 matured cohorts.",
