    "words": "The pictures above come from replaying each class's own entry rule over the price history on record. That replay is history, computed today; it wrote nothing to the public record. The study corpus behind the design holds 296,093 graded cases, but its per-case rows are not on this disk and its own races stopped at 20 sessions, so the long end of these pictures rests on the shipped history's span alone, and the claim is narrowed to match."
